---
title: Request Sequence Diagram
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant N as Next.js (Vercel)
    participant A as Actix-Web (Render :8080)
    participant P as Python FastAPI (:8001)
    participant X as C++ / Zig subprocess
    participant D as C# / Dafny / F* subprocess

    B->>N: GET /
    N-->>B: Full HTML (SSR) with HTMX+Alpine+Hyperscript

    note over B,N: HTMX interaction
    B->>A: hx-get /health  (direct HTMX call)
    A-->>B: JSON {status:"healthy"}

    note over B,N: React fetch via proxy
    B->>N: fetch /api/proxy/rust
    N->>A: GET /api/rust
    A-->>N: {language:"Rust", result:"..."}
    N-->>B: JSON forwarded

    B->>N: fetch /api/proxy/python
    N->>A: GET /api/python
    A->>P: GET /compute
    P-->>A: {result:"Python3 | fib(15)=610 ..."}
    A-->>N: LangResponse JSON
    N-->>B: JSON

    B->>N: fetch /api/proxy/cpp
    N->>A: GET /api/cpp
    A->>X: g++ compile & execute
    X-->>A: stdout
    A-->>N: LangResponse JSON
    N-->>B: JSON

    B->>N: POST /api/sqljs
    N-->>B: {rows:[{answer:42}], engine:"sql.js"}

    B->>N: POST /api/phpjs
    N-->>B: {output:"PHP-WASM | 1024 ...", exit_code:0}
